      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 27,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಬ್ರಹ್ಮ ಗಡ । ಸ್ಥಿತಿಗೆ ಆ ವಿಷ್ಣು ಗಡ\nಹತವ ಮಾಡುವಡೆ ರುದ್ರ ಗಡ - ಎಂದೆಂಬ\nಸ್ಥಿತಿಯ ತಿಳಿಯೆಂದ ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು#ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ_ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "fbf7f85f01d6d031fee7fd8e203b197579cb2405b704ca20947c764c65c7f439",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0028",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 28,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ದಿಟವೆ ಪುಣ್ಯದ ಪುಂಜ । ಸಟೆಯೆ ಪಾಪದ ಬೀಜ\nಕುಟಿಲ ವಂಚನೆಯ ಪೊಗದಿರು - ನಿಜವ ಪಿಡಿ\nಘಟವ ನೆಚ್ಚದಿರು ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು#ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ_ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "1e42692d5c29b4ff4d38880df580cad5a7f0e2add6bae57f2880c152f7fdfad2",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0029",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 29,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಪರಮನೈಮೊಗ ಉಳಿದು । ನೆರವಿಯನೊಲ್ಲದೆ\nನರರೊಪ ಧರಿಸಿ ಗುರುವಾಗಿ - ಬೋಧಿಪಗೆ\nಸರಿ ಯಾರ ಕಾಣೆ ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು#ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ_ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "55395b4610e663e931ae24044caeb785ed518c4bdc4ab379abd025d55330c716",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0030",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 30,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಪರತತ್ವ ತನ್ನೊಳಗೆ । ಎರವಿಲ್ಲದಿರುತಿರಲು\nಪರದೇಶಿಯಾಗಿ ಇರುತಿರು - ವಾತನ\nಪರಮ ಗುರುವೆಂಬೆ ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು#ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ_ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "43f88f43775298143c361598519769777e024a79f46f561fe8c183d72620db7f",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0031",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 31,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಸುರತರು ಮರನಲ್ಲ । ಸುರಭಿಯೊಂದಾವಲ್ಲ\nಪರುಷ ಪಾಷಾಣದೊಳಗಲ್ಲ - ಗುರುವು ತಾ\nನರರೊಳಗಲ್ಲ ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು#ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ_ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "2d81eb499b662abb2a706bd7b28f2ec8e5ac09ad52f1e33229bf7a92aa8b297a",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0032",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 32,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ದರುಶನವಾರಿರಃ । ಪುರುಷರು ಮೂವರಿಂ\nಪರತತ್ವದಿರವು ಬೇರೆಂದು - ತೋರಿದ\nಗುರು ತಾನೆ ದೈವ ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು#ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ_ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "b82ab8fdd39630b932473d682e4a408f57426e7e5f0c14b0572be65c38674a30",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0033",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 33,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಜ್ಯೋತಿಯಿಂದವೆ ನೇತ್ರ । ರಾತ್ರಿಯಲಿ ಕಾಂಬಂತೆ\nಸೂತ್ರದಲಿ ಧಾತನರೆವಂತೆ - ಶಿವನ ಗುರು\nನಾಥನಿಂದರಿಗು ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು#ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ_ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "08410085b6e2802774d518221e37759caeddeb7d9144da0f0c7be49079a02f71",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0034",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 34,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಬ್ರಹ್ಮವೆಂಬುದು ತಾನು । ಒಮ್ಮಾರು ನೀಳವೇ\nಒಮ್ಮೆ ಸದ್ಗುರುವಿನುಪದೇಶ - ವಾಲಿಸಲು\nಗಮ್ಮನೆ ಮುಕ್ತಿ ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು#ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ_ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "3bc0fa512a5c8259f6c55ddf2cae6e33d80bf218347ad6549e2f2e588c699b5f",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0035",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 35,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಹರ ತನ್ನೊಳಿರ್ದುದ । ಗುರುತೋರಿ । ದಿರಲಹುದೆ ।\nಮರನೊಳಗ್ನಿ ಇರುತಿರ್ದು - ತನ್ನ ತಾ\nನುರಿವುದ ಕಂಡ ? ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು#ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ_ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "cb7be0d8eb8c4e8b3c3976534cd2c3a680d54ad28b66b65585f41c457e0b182b",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0036",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 36,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ನರಕ ಪಾಪಿಷ್ಠರಿಗೆ । ಸುರಲೋಕ ( ದಿಟ್ಟರಿಗೆ )\nಗುರುಬೋಧೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಜಗ ಉಳಿಗು - ಮಲ್ಲದೊಡೆ\nಉರಿದು ಹೋಗುವುದು ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು#ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ_ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "7ca3aaa1135815a4356cf67c1eae232b0a91ba33df4c91df87d2624fa00d34ee",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0037",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 37,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಮರಹುಳ್ಳ ಮನುಜರಿಗೆ । ತೆರನಾವುರೆವುದಕೆ\nಕರಿಗೊಂಡ ಭ್ರಮೆಯ ಪರೆವ - ಗುರುವಿನ ಭೋಧೆ\nಕರಿಗೊಳ್ಳಬೇಕು ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು#ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ_ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "8fcaad2a9f59411dc61a4aa1e165b8af7cd98e7eb6e5c6494a2c33d5955411d7",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0038",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 38,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಮಂಡೆ ಬೋಳಾದೊಡಂ । ದಂಡು ಕೋಲ್ವಿಡಿದೊಡಂ\nಹೆಂಡತಿಯ ಬಿಟ್ಟು ನಡೆದೊಡಂ - ಗುರುಮುಖವ\nಕಂಡಲ್ಲದಿಲ್ಲ ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು#ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ_ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "c9ef09d1c54dfc6ce4cdeda5e19678bc339ae1541f4166ad7d8563702900a01e",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0039",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 39,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಮೂರುಕಣ್ಣೀಶ್ವರನ । ತೋರಿಕೊಡಬಲ್ಲ ಗುರು\nಬೇರರಿವುದೊಂದು ತೆರನಿಲ್ಲ - ಗುರುಕರಣ\nತೋರಿಸುಗು ಶಿವನ ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು#ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ_ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "ca8242f5001b3d004d757740cbd6ccc92168e2998e60a46e956f142b980a3736",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0040",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 40,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಊರಿಗೆ ದಾರಿಯ । ನಾರು ತೋರಿದರೇನು\nಸಾರಾಯಮಪ್ಪ ಮತವನರಿಹಿಸುವ ಗುರು\nಆರಾದೊಡೇನು ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು#ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ_ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "a551b4e86b41c193027260dd3982c31995d3ccf4d606dffcf54fdcc5c42929d5",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
